PTX MP+fence-restrict-both
"Both restricted fences, with the data in the consumer CTA's shared memory written by the producer through its own window: the producer's write is to CTA 1's memory, not its own, so the release side does not order it (D17). Expected: allowed."
{
s=0 @cta 1;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                             ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster s, 1                     | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f                             ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster | fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster.cluster ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1                          | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, s                            ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
